  "description": "Open, create, edit, calculate and save Excel workbooks (.xlsx, .xlsm) in managed .NET, keeping every part of the file you did not change; no Office, no interop, no third-party dependencies, and no need for the DocWright Word package. XlsxDocument edits cells, formulas, styles, rich text, rows, columns and sheets with every reference following; calculates formulas (439 functions); sorts, filters and groups; and reads, adds and changes tables, charts, pivot tables, sparklines, pictures, shapes, form controls, conditional formats, data validation, notes, defined names, hyperlinks, scenarios, protection and page setup. Fills templates and placeholders, imports and exports objects and DataTables, writes CSV, JSON, Markdown and OpenDocument (.ods), and shows a value through its number format as Excel does. PDF, images and HTML: DocWright.Spreadsheet.Rendering; encrypted workbooks: DocWright.Spreadsheet.Security; legacy .xls: DocWright.Spreadsheet.Xls.",
